// Runeforge workstation policy tests (host build; no game types).
// 1. Replays the shared reference-model vectors (tests/data/workstation-vectors.v3.txt, generated by
//    feasr-core/alpha/workstation/model/gen_vectors_v3.mjs from workstation_model_v4.mjs): every state, token and effect
//    must match exactly. RC1 keeps tests/data/workstation-vectors.v1.txt and RC1-WS r1 workstation-vectors.v2.txt as history.
// 2. Layout (S/I lines) and slab frame (F lines) vectors against LayoutPolicy / ShotPolicy.
// 3. Unit checks for the input, protocol v3, context/legacy, shot, lease, controls (R3.1 ControlMap layout, self-check,
//    toggle, verified restore), seat v2 (authored datum), staging gate, readiness, view and free-camera policies
//    (RC1-WS r2, PRES-D27..D31, PRES-D33/D34).
// Usage: runeforge_workstation_policy_tests <path to workstation-vectors.v3.txt>
